<title>USA: Tag Heuer Q1 sales, oper income rise.</title>
<headline>Tag Heuer Q1 sales, oper income rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss watchmaker Tag Heuer International SA said on Wednesday that its first quarter sales totaled 109.7 Swiss francs, an increase of 1.2 percent from last year's first quarter, and its operating income increased 8.9 percent to 23.2 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>In last year's first quarter, the company reported operating income of 21.3 million Swiss francs.  </p>
<p>Tag Heuer said it continues to expect double-digit sales growth for the full year of 1997 with the help of a new line of watches in autumn.</p>
</text>
